=== hk-11-authenticate-or-request
from: MVC::Keayl 0.9.2 lib/MVC/Keayl/Controller.rakumod:713
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: || between two method calls where the first takes a block argument
--- code
my class Ctl {
    method authenticate-with-http-token(&block) { &block() }
    method request-http-token-authentication($realm) { "auth: $realm" }
    method check($realm, &block) {
        self.authenticate-with-http-token(&block) || self.request-http-token-authentication($realm)
    }
}
say Ctl.new.check('r', { False });
say Ctl.new.check('r', { 'ok' })
--- expect
auth: r
ok

